```catala-metadata
## A very complex enumeration such that:
## small line
## another small line
## Nunc eleifend leo vitae magna. In id erat non orci commodo lobortis.
## Sed diam. Praesent fermentum tempor tellus. Nullam tempus.
## Phasellus purus. Pellentesque tristique imperdiet tortor. Nam euismod tellus id erat.
declaration enumeration E:
  ## Case A
  -- A
  ## Case B
  -- B content integer

## A not-so-much complex structure
declaration structure S:
  ## Contains something
  data x1 content integer
  #[doc="Contains something else"]
  data x2 content integer

## A structure following another one,
# something irrelevant
## documented with comments
#[doc="and an attribute"]
declaration structure U:
  ## Contains an integer
  data y content integer

## A simple scope named T
declaration scope T:
  ## An integer input
  input x content integer
  ## An enum input
  # something irrelevant
  ## named e
  input e content E
  ## A context variable
  context c content integer
  ## An internal variable
  internal i content integer

  ## The computation result in a struct
  output s content S
  ## Another result, in a struct documented with an attribute
  output u content U

scope T:
  definition c equals 0
  definition i equals 0
  definition s equals
    S { -- x1: x -- x2: match e with pattern -- A : c + i -- B content x : x }
  definition u equals U { -- y: x }
```

